# Azure Kinect SDK binaries — Windows x86_64 only, ~430MB total.
# Re-fetch on Windows: clone microsoft/Azure-Kinect-Samples, run
# body-tracking-samples/sample_unity_bodytracking/MoveLibraryFiles.bat after
# `nuget restore packages.config -PackagesDirectory packages`, then copy
# DLLs into the locations below.
